sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Writer A
    participant B as Writer B
    participant E as entry table
    participant C as Checkpointer
    A->>E: INSERT fee entry, gets id 101
    Note over A: transaction open
    B->>E: INSERT fee entry, gets id 102
    B->>E: COMMIT
    C->>E: max(id) = 102, sum what is visible
    Note over C: 101 not committed, not visible<br/>checkpoint: "up to 102"
    A->>E: COMMIT — 101 is now visible
    Note over E: next checkpoint starts after 102<br/>reads add only id > 102<br/>101 is never counted
